### Variables Globales
@host = http://localhost:3000
@token = 

# ==============================================================================
# Módulo de Clientes (Clients)
# ==============================================================================

### 1. Listar Clientes (Límite máximo: 50)
GET {{host}}/api/clients?limit=50
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Filtrar Clientes por Búsqueda (Documento, Nombre, Email, Teléfono)
GET {{host}}/api/clients?search=gourmet&isActive=true
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Registrar Nuevo Cliente
POST {{host}}/api/clients
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentId": "J-98765432-1",
  "name": "Restaurante El Rincón Gourmet C.A.",
  "email": "contacto@rincongourmet.com",
  "phone": "+58 412 1234567",
  "address": "Av. Las Delicias, Centro Empresarial Torre B, Local 12",
  "notes": "Cliente corporativo, entregas de lunes a viernes en horario matutino"
}

### 4. Obtener Cliente por ID
@clientId = 65e5a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d2
GET {{host}}/api/clients/{{clientId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Actualizar Cliente
PUT {{host}}/api/clients/{{clientId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+58 412 7654321",
  "address": "Av. Las Delicias, Edificio Torre B, Local 14 (Nueva Sede)",
  "notes": "Actualización de dirección principal de despacho"
}

### 6. Dar de Baja Cliente (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{host}}/api/clients/{{clientId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
